msgid "U575 retained elapsed-time domain"
msgstr "U575 retained elapsed-time domain"

msgid "`Nexus::U575RetainedTime` provides an explicit elapsed clock for the exact STM32U575ZIT6Q TZEN0 baremetal reference. It reads an externally prepared retained RTC without changing hardware. It does not enter a power mode, restore clocks, provide LPBAM or prove physical Stop2 continuity. The original {download}`IO-32 <io-evolution-execution.csv>` and {download}`SOC-35 <soc-refinement-execution.csv>` exits remain open; physical HIL is `not_executed`."
msgstr "`Nexus::U575RetainedTime` provides an explicit elapsed clock for the exact STM32U575ZIT6Q TZEN0 baremetal reference. It reads an externally prepared retained RTC without changing hardware. It does not enter a power mode, restore clocks, provide LPBAM or prove physical Stop2 continuity. The original {download}`IO-32 <io-evolution-execution.csv>` and {download}`SOC-35 <soc-refinement-execution.csv>` exits remain open; physical HIL is `not_executed`."

